Z||000002||Wolfhound||12-16-1999||06:37 AM||||Here,s funny for you, and true.<BR> While driving through Opelika Alabama a few weeks ago I was caught in traffic as the high school turned out. In an area where the four lane merges into two there was a car ahead that was smoking so bad I couldn't make out what kind it was backing up traffic. As it open up to four lanes again I finally made it up to see what was there.<BR>It was a rusty four door late 60's Chevelle with both back door windows covered with plastic and duct tape. Written across the lower back window in custom vinyl letters.....<BR> "DIGITAL HORN, WATCH FINGER"<BR>I found it hard to drive from laughing!||||reg||7
